The bylaws state that members may borrow books from the library. Every member is allowed to keep a borrowed book for a period of two weeks before it must be returned to the library. [[cite:obs-9b525e2a0dbc741dee8f7ba775617ec574d065ea "The bylaws states that a member may borrow books for a period of two weeks."]] [[cite:obs-c39bcdab977c36e67ef066088d700d04a8e26e5c "The bylaws states that books must be returned within two weeks of borrowing."]]